 can't teach you anything more. \" So I went to Chicago to study with Roy Knapp. Remember Roy Knapp? He taught Gene Krupa. Buddy Rich took a few lessons with him too. When I went to study with Roy Knapp, he had me play something on the drum set. He said, \"I can't teach you anything. You know it all already. \" I said, \" ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10841$22610CF8-5D0B-47A0-8024-59D35D72DAD4", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "86b99b1fbffd1b46f46176be321f18ce1d936bd5", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/45.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10841$9C583DF4-4822-4F34-A923-5EF51F102626", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "55b04cb7baa96ca6be10e015e9b73f02f9bd0c68", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1196, "id": "Q1196"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10841$A3A79124-AAF5-4EDE-BE73-3754CCA439FF", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "9275854cdcc21cf5099a2e2d934d077216ea6898", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 252, "id": "Q252"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10841$F7710DD2-F7C7-4E73-9334-BF4A785A0A95", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "09db65f49ea0a2ec0ce70f870c7756ac61475a84", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 141, "id": "Q141"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10841$B9D6456C-11E4-46B5-B045-439674809E32", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0e5ce292df993d79dcf01467e0e5a2c8509775e9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type":